#AREA New Singase~
#AUTHORS Tazzy Pythos Brrr~
#RANGES 5 35 0 99
#RESETMSG A large group of villagers gather to discuss academic topics.~
#FLAGS AFLAG_FREEQUIT

#TEMPERATURE 40 80 30 7

#HELPS
-1 NEW_SINGASE_CHANGES~
01.01.05 - 35 Spelling Corrections. (Mag)
01.01.05 - Changed formatting of code for easier reading. (Mag)
01.01.05 - Changed mpqiet to mpquiet in mob 6907 and 6908 fight_prog. (Mag)
01.01.05 - Added missing endif in fight_prog of mob 6905. (Mag)
01.01.05 - Added missing endif in speech_prog test of mob 6911. (Mag)
01.01.05 - Added missing endif in mob 6914. (Mag)
01.01.05 - Changed wording in many descriptions. (Mag)
01.01.05 - Changed mpjunk <itemname> to mpjunk i####. (Mag)
01.01.05 - Added color to gate signs. (Mag)
01.02.05 - Added additional quest mob responses based on $n quest status. (Mag)
01.02.05 - Added the ability for questor to respond no during topaz quest.
           Doing so will reset your qbits to the previous step.  It will also
           transfer you from the private room if you are there. (Mag)
~
-1 NEWSING 'New Singase'~
{130}                           New Singase{300}
The village of New Singase, like its predecessor, grew out of an old trading
post in the Valdemar region, but unlike its predecessor, came to be long after
the Order-Chaos wars.  They still value wisdom and cherish their philosophers.
The great wealth this village has acquired is shown quite abundantly in their
choice of pavement stones-gems of all kinds and values.  On a bright summer day,
it is nearly impossible to see beyond one's sandalled feet due to the glare and
glitter of the gemstone-paved avenues.  To learn from such as these magi, one
must be very careful as things are not always as they appear.
~
0 $~

#MOBILES
#6900 guard~
A New Singase Guard~
A New Singase Guard stands alert to defend the village against intruders.~
The first thing you notice when you see him are numerous battle decorations.
Obviously, he acted with great honor and courage in a great multitude of
military skirmishes.  As you get past his decorations and look at him, you see
him standing alert and studying you to determine whether you are friend or foe.
He is tall for a gnome and wise beyond his years.  His armor is impressively
made, using the most expensive and beautiful metals available while still
keeping the strength of the armor.  Attacking him would be quite foolish.~
ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_BODY|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_INFRARED|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_PROTECT_EVIL|AFF_PROTECT_GOOD|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_HUNT
500 S
50 BODY_ARM|BODY_FOOT|BODY_TORSO|BODY_HEAD BODY_FOOT|BODY_HAND|BODY_HEAD 5d10+1300 4d7+35
175000 RACE_GNOME POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
  if quest(0,1,$n) == 1
    mpechoat $n {110}The guard's eyes glow red with fury at your presence!{300}
    mpechoaround $n {110}The guard's eyes glow red with fury at $n's presence!{300}
    shout An enemy of Governor Sohtyp has come to loot the village!
    mpkill $n
  endif
~
>speech_prog friend~
  unlock gate
  open gate
  say Welcome, friend.
~
>speech_prog foe~
  mpmset $n quest 0 1 1
  mpechoat $n {110}The guard's eyes glow red with fury at your presence!{300}
  mpechoaround $n {110}The guard's eyes glow red with fury at $n's presence!{300}
  mpkill $n
~
>death_prog 100~
  if quest(0,1,$n) == 0
    mpmset $n quest 0 1 1
  endif
  shout $n is a sworn enemy of Governor Sohtyp!
  shout Avenge me!  Defend our village!
  if level($n) >= 75
    mppurge $i
  endif
~
>give_prog I27721~
  mpjunk i27721
  mpechoat $n A Guard of New Singase looks at you with a skeptical eye.
  mpechoaround $n A guard of New Singase looks at $n with a skeptical eye.
  if inroom($n) == 6952
    mpoload 6913
    mpoload 6915
    mpquiet on
    wear i6913
    wear i6915
    mpquiet off
  else
    if inroom($n) == 6951
      mpoload 6910
      mpoload 6911
      mpquiet on
      wear i6910
      wear i6911
      mpquiet off
    else
      if inroom($n) == 6950
        mpoload 6912
        mpoload 6914
        mpquiet on
        wear i6912
        wear i6914
        mpquiet off
      else
        if inroom($n) == 6949
          mpoload 6916
          mpoload 6917
          mpoload 6918
          mpquiet on
          wear i6916
          wear i6917
          wear i6918
          mpquiet off
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
~
>rand_prog 50~
  if inroom($i) == 6949
    or inroom($i) == 6950
      or inroom($i) == 6951
        or inroom($i) == 6952
          break
  else
    mppurge $i
  endif
~
|

#6901
female visitor~
A female visitor~
A female visitor walks by, awestruck by the sights and sounds.~
She is moderately dressed, wearing clothes of someone on a journey.  She seems
totally enthralled by the elegant extravagance of the village and jabbers with
anybody who will permit her about everything she has seen, only to interrupt
herself as she sees a new wonder.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_RACE
