#6902
male visitor~
A male visitor~
A male visitor stands here, pondering the great wealth of the village.~
This visitor has obviously travelled a long distance.  His clothes are covered
with dust and the smell of saltwater stays with him wherever he goes.  He stops
every now and then to think, probably about everything he sees here.  He seems
to be in no hurry to get anywhere.~
