#6904
female villager~
A female villager~
A female villager meanders through the village, smiling at everyone she meets.~
She is beautifully adorned with jewels on her clothes, in her hair, on her
fingers and probably even rings on her toes.  You can't tell if she is well to
do or not because every villager is comparably dressed.  She seems willing to
to talk with villagers and visitors alike.  You can't help thinking you would
love to live here.~
