#6906 street worker~
A street worker~
A street worker leans on a shovel.~
He is obviously not from this village but called in to build the streets here.
His attitude is much less affable than that of the villagers and his work ethic
leaves much to be desired.  He wears filthy clothes you would expect from a hard
working man, but you can't see how he finds the time to get dirty, what with
having to exert so much energy holding that shovel up and all.
~
