#6910
Jean~
Jean-Pierre~
Jean-Pierre awaits the arrival of another student.~
He carries himself in a very nondescript manner and his clothing is impressive
in its understatement.  He wears very little which would give the appearance of
the wealth he obviously has, instead, choosing to wear the garb you would
expect of visitors to the village.  He has a very average form, slightly heavier
than optimum for his average stature, balding ever so slightly, slumped a bit
from years of improper posture.  Could he possibly be someone from which to
learn? ~
