#6911
Claude~
Claude~
Claude is awaiting the arrival of a new student.~
You see before you a man who has serious problems choosing items to wear.  He
has a huge number of rings, necklaces, and bracelets on, none of which come
close to matching his disheveled clothing.  He obviously just grabbed stuff, put
it on and, deciding it didn't look right, just put something else on without
bothering to remove the first item.  He is a pitiful sight.~
