#6900
ornate key~
An ornate key~
An ornate key has been discarded.~
This key is one of the most elaborately designed keys you have seen.  It is
made of gold, covered with small diamonds, rubies, sapphires, and emeralds.
The handle extends to a triple-loop at one end and an intricate section for
tripping tumblers in a lock designed to be pick proof.  The craftsmanship is
unequalled in both design and beauty.~
