#6900
Centre du Village~
You stand in the center of the village.  All around are wondrous sights to
behold.  Streets paved with gemstones, houses covered with gold and gems,
exotic plants, tropical birds, art and sculptures that dazzle the mind are
around every corner.  The villagers act as if these are all commonplace, and
indeed they are, at least in this village.  You feel a sense of peace and
comfort as you drink in the atmosphere.  This is a good place to reflect
upon your achievements.
{120}     A note board sits here.{300} ~
