#6901
An Intersection~
You stand in an intersection like all the other intersections in this village,
but very unlike any intersection you have seen anywhere in your travels across
the realms.  Gemstones are everywhere and in great numbers.  Priceless works of
art cover the outsides of the buildings and sculptures of great value sit on
the edge of the streets.  Every once in a while, you notice someone peer around
to see if anyone is watching, drop to their knees, pry at a gemstone in the
pavement, then give up and walk away.~
