#6917
Rue de Tethyr~
This street, like many other streets in this village is paved with precious
stones and gems.  You examine carefully how the villagers walk across them.
The older villagers walk on them like it was made of cheap material, yet some
others walk carefully as not to harm the street.  You occasionally notice a
visitor attempt to remove a stone.  Unsuccessful, the visitor keeps walking
down the street.  For some reason you notice the diamonds catch your eye. You
notice a significant gathering to the south, it must be where everyone gathers
to discuss matters and catch up.~
