#6955
Maison d'Audrey Renee-Maree~
As you enter Audrey Renee-Maree's house you are immediately thrown back by
its elegance and beauty, even for this village!  Nothing you have ever seen
compares to this, except one other house in this village.  The walls are
adorned with beautiful tapestries and jewel encrusted, gold framed portraits.
One of them looking quite like Laura Annette.  The ceiling is covered by one
huge painting depicting a story of times long ago, the floors are bare but
polished so highly that you can see your reflection as if there were a second
you beneath you.  The chaise-lounge, sofas, short tables, and light fixtures
are all of the most elegant nature.  You could spend hours looking around the
house without becoming bored.~
