#6957
Maison de Claude~
You have entered the home of a hopeless art collector.  Expensive works of art
are everywhere.  Tapestry covered walls with paintings hung over them and each
other.  Exquisitely carved pieces of furniture with sculptures placed on top,
in front of, behind, and under them.  Elaborate lighting fixtures with glass,
emerald, diamond and ruby menagerie hanging from them.  Each item would look
absolutely beautiful if not for all the other things around it.  As it is, the
number of pieces and the manner in which they are placed make them an eyesore.~
