type.  As you handle the suit of armor, you are amazed by its lack of weight
and nearly impenetrable nature.  The craftsmanship is quite amazing as you see
no seams, joints, welds or anything connecting the flexible portions to the
rigid portions.  That this suit is entirely complete from the top of the head
to the fingertips to the toes and is still only in two pieces is mind boggling.~
E
two handed sword~
It is highly polished and quite sharp.  It is much heavier than the average
fighter would use.  You cringe as you think about the size of the fighter
needed to handle such a weapon!  You wouldn't want to meet him in a dark alley!~
E
west w we wes~
To the west, you can see the southwestern tower looming nearby and beyond that
the Singase Plains open up before you.  Obviously, this tower is in a good 
position to protect the southwestern tower or be protected by that same tower
in the event of an attack.~
E
east e ea eas~
To the east you can see the southeastern tower nearby.  In the distance you
can see the parts of the Singase Plains that extend east.  Protecting the
southeastern tower from attack would be quite simple from here, as would it
be for the guards and soldiers from there to protect this tower.~
E
south s so sou sout~
To the south, the Singase Plains spread as far as the eye can see.  It is easy
to see that no enemy can approach the village unseen from that direction.~
S

