#6974
The South Tower~
You have reached the top of the South Tower.  You realize the great height of
this tower and shrink back from the edge fearing the slightest breeze could
send you plummeting 200 meters to your death.  From this vantage point, you
can see the entire village and surrounding countryside.  This is a perfect
to situate archers to rain down death and destruction on infidels before they
are near enough to make any kind of offensive move against the village.  It
would be foolish for any but the strongest foes to attempt an attack.  The
southeast and southwest towers are in close proximity and capable of rapidly
reinforcing this tower if the need should arise.~
