#6988
On the Wall~
You are walking on an amazingly wide wall.  It has such great breadth that an
entire company of soldiers can stand in parade formation starting at one side
of the wall and not reach the other side.  There is no way in your imagination
to breach this wall.  You can see the entire village and a huge amount of the
plains stretching out before you.  The towers loom roughly ten meters higher
than your present elevation.  You can hear the peaceful sounds of the local
people as they discuss various topics of interest far below you.~
